  m_Name: "\u628A\u624B2"
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dialogue_SO
  _lines:
  - It was locked to the wardrobe
  - "I couldn\u2019t budge it open"
  - Then the wardrobe started shaking
  - The wardrobe door opened a crack revealing a pale hand coming out of the wardrobe
  - The wardrobe shut itself
  - I attributed it to my eyes seeing things
  - "My heart didn\u2019t want to believe me, though"
